{%- comment -%}
  House Principles — SIMPLIFIED (the previous pass was too decorative: diamond-outline graphics, a
  Cinnabar geometric room, the House Seal used as a full-screen substitute for photography, and an
  oversized title. All of that is removed here). Rumaya's core interaction principle only — large
  visual rooms + one stable central title that automatically changes as the user scrolls between
  them. Photography + typography, nothing else.

  This is an independent experience from Edition I — separate numbering, separate copy, separate
  interaction state (--house-code-progress/data-house-code-active, never --caviera-progress). It
  ends at 04 / Longevity; Edition I begins as its own, unrelated section afterward.

  ARCHITECTURE: the section's own height comes ONLY from .caviera-house-codes__panels (four real,
  in-flow, min-height: 95svh panels — no artificial pinning distance). .caviera-house-codes__
  overlay-shell is position: absolute; inset: 0 inside this section (position: relative) — it
  always matches its positioned ancestor's box exactly and contributes NOTHING to that ancestor's
  own height calculation, so it can never distort it (see assets/caviera-house-codes.css for the
  full implementation). Inside the shell, .caviera-house-codes__overlay is position: sticky; top:
  0; height: 100svh — its sticky range is bounded by the shell, i.e. the section's real height,
  whatever that naturally is.

  ACTIVE-CHAPTER FIX: assets/caviera-house-codes.js previously used an IntersectionObserver
  threshold that could never actually be reached against full-viewport-height panels (see the fix
  note there) — the title was effectively stuck on Rarity. Replaced with a deterministic "closest
  panel centre to viewport centre" calculation, recomputed on every scroll frame, so it updates
  correctly scrolling in either direction.

  The four House Principles are CAVIERA's existing official House pillars (sections/caviera-house-
  statement.liquid) — same four names and approved short copy, not invented here: Rarity,
  Precision, Ritual, Longevity. Theme Editor settings (image + short line per code) are unchanged
  from the previous build, so any values a merchant already entered are preserved.

  PROGRESSIVE ENHANCEMENT: every panel carries its own real, always-visible local heading + copy
  (.caviera-house-codes__local-label) — not a screen-reader-only duplicate. assets/caviera-house-
  codes.js adds `is-ready` to the section only once detection has actually been wired up; only THEN
  does desktop CSS visually hide the local labels in favour of the sticky overlay (see the
  `.caviera-house-codes.is-ready` gate in the CSS) — so a slow/blocked/failed script never leaves a
  panel with no visible title at all. The overlay itself is aria-hidden and is hidden outright below
  900px and under prefers-reduced-motion, at which point the local labels are already the whole
  story.

  IMAGE FALLBACKS — simple, per brief: if a Theme Editor image is set for a code, it renders exactly
  as uploaded. If not, EVERY code temporarily reuses the same single bundled campaign photograph
  (assets/15_oryx_necklace_on_model.png) with a different static crop (see [data-derived="true"] in
  assets/caviera-house-codes.css) — never a decorative graphic, diamond shape, or brand mark
  standing in for photography. Purely temporary until real per-Principle photography is uploaded.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign rarity_img = section.settings.rarity_image
  assign precision_img = section.settings.precision_image
  assign ritual_img = section.settings.ritual_image
  assign longevity_img = section.settings.longevity_image
  assign bundled_file = '15_oryx_necklace_on_model.png'

  assign rarity_derived = false
  if rarity_img == blank
    assign rarity_derived = true
  endif
  assign precision_derived = false
  if precision_img == blank
    assign precision_derived = true
  endif
  assign ritual_derived = false
  if ritual_img == blank
    assign ritual_derived = true
  endif
  assign longevity_derived = false
  if longevity_img == blank
    assign longevity_derived = true
  endif
-%}
{{ 'caviera-house-codes.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<section class="caviera-house-codes" data-scheme="obsidian" data-house-code-active="0">
  <div class="caviera-house-codes__panels">
    {%- comment -%} 01 RARITY {%- endcomment -%}
    <article class="caviera-house-codes__panel" data-house-code-index="0" data-derived="{{ rarity_derived }}">
      <div class="caviera-house-codes__media">
        {%- if rarity_img != blank -%}
          <img
            src="{{ rarity_img | image_url: width: 1600 }}"
            srcset="{{ rarity_img | image_url: width: 800 }} 800w, {{ rarity_img | image_url: width: 1600 }} 1600w, {{ rarity_img | image_url: width: 2200 }} 2200w"
            sizes="100vw"
            width="{{ rarity_img.width }}" height="{{ rarity_img.height }}"
            alt="{{ rarity_img.alt | default: 'Rarity' | escape }}"
            loading="lazy"
          >
        {%- else -%}
          <img src="{{ bundled_file | asset_url }}" width="521" height="358" alt="Rarity" loading="lazy">
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
      <div class="caviera-house-codes__scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="caviera-house-codes__local-label">
        <span class="caviera-house-codes__local-index">01 / 04</span>
        <h3>Rarity</h3>
        {%- if section.settings.rarity_copy != blank -%}<p>{{ section.settings.rarity_copy }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </article>

    {%- comment -%} 02 PRECISION — no photograph exists yet; temporarily reuses the same bundled photo with a distinct crop. {%- endcomment -%}
    <article class="caviera-house-codes__panel" data-house-code-index="1" data-derived="{{ precision_derived }}">
      <div class="caviera-house-codes__media">
        {%- if precision_img != blank -%}
          <img
            src="{{ precision_img | image_url: width: 1600 }}"
            srcset="{{ precision_img | image_url: width: 800 }} 800w, {{ precision_img | image_url: width: 1600 }} 1600w, {{ precision_img | image_url: width: 2200 }} 2200w"
            sizes="100vw"
            width="{{ precision_img.width }}" height="{{ precision_img.height }}"
            alt="{{ precision_img.alt | default: 'Precision' | escape }}"
            loading="lazy"
          >
        {%- else -%}
          <img src="{{ bundled_file | asset_url }}" width="521" height="358" alt="Precision" loading="lazy">
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
      <div class="caviera-house-codes__scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="caviera-house-codes__local-label">
        <span class="caviera-house-codes__local-index">02 / 04</span>
        <h3>Precision</h3>
        {%- if section.settings.precision_copy != blank -%}<p>{{ section.settings.precision_copy }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </article>

    {%- comment -%} 03 RITUAL — no photograph exists yet; temporarily reuses the same bundled photo with a distinct crop. {%- endcomment -%}
    <article class="caviera-house-codes__panel" data-house-code-index="2" data-derived="{{ ritual_derived }}">
      <div class="caviera-house-codes__media">
        {%- if ritual_img != blank -%}
          <img
            src="{{ ritual_img | image_url: width: 1600 }}"
            srcset="{{ ritual_img | image_url: width: 800 }} 800w, {{ ritual_img | image_url: width: 1600 }} 1600w, {{ ritual_img | image_url: width: 2200 }} 2200w"
            sizes="100vw"
            width="{{ ritual_img.width }}" height="{{ ritual_img.height }}"
            alt="{{ ritual_img.alt | default: 'Ritual' | escape }}"
            loading="lazy"
          >
        {%- else -%}
          <img src="{{ bundled_file | asset_url }}" width="521" height="358" alt="Ritual" loading="lazy">
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
      <div class="caviera-house-codes__scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="caviera-house-codes__local-label">
        <span class="caviera-house-codes__local-index">03 / 04</span>
        <h3>Ritual</h3>
        {%- if section.settings.ritual_copy != blank -%}<p>{{ section.settings.ritual_copy }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </article>

    {%- comment -%} 04 LONGEVITY — no photograph exists yet; temporarily reuses the same bundled photo with a distinct crop. {%- endcomment -%}
    <article class="caviera-house-codes__panel" data-house-code-index="3" data-derived="{{ longevity_derived }}">
      <div class="caviera-house-codes__media">
        {%- if longevity_img != blank -%}
          <img
            src="{{ longevity_img | image_url: width: 1600 }}"
            srcset="{{ longevity_img | image_url: width: 800 }} 800w, {{ longevity_img | image_url: width: 1600 }} 1600w, {{ longevity_img | image_url: width: 2200 }} 2200w"
            sizes="100vw"
            width="{{ longevity_img.width }}" height="{{ longevity_img.height }}"
            alt="{{ longevity_img.alt | default: 'Longevity' | escape }}"
            loading="lazy"
          >
        {%- else -%}
          <img src="{{ bundled_file | asset_url }}" width="521" height="358" alt="Longevity" loading="lazy">
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
      <div class="caviera-house-codes__scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="caviera-house-codes__local-label">
        <span class="caviera-house-codes__local-index">04 / 04</span>
        <h3>Longevity</h3>
        {%- if section.settings.longevity_copy != blank -%}<p>{{ section.settings.longevity_copy }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%}
    Sticky central overlay — decorative duplicate of the local labels above; safely aria-hidden
    since the same heading/copy already exists, in reading order, inside each panel. Every item
    renders unconditionally (no [data-reveal], no JS dependency) so the Rarity item is what's on
    screen even if assets/caviera-house-codes.js never runs at all (see data-house-code-active="0"
    above, set as a static default directly in the markup).
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-shell" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="caviera-house-codes__overlay">
      <span class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-label">The House / Principles</span>
      <div class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-item" data-house-code-index="0">
        <span class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-progress">01 / 04</span>
        <p class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-title">Rarity</p>
        {%- if section.settings.rarity_copy != blank -%}<p class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-copy">{{ section.settings.rarity_copy }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      </div>
      <div class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-item" data-house-code-index="1">
        <span class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-progress">02 / 04</span>
        <p class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-title">Precision</p>
        {%- if section.settings.precision_copy != blank -%}<p class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-copy">{{ section.settings.precision_copy }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      </div>
      <div class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-item" data-house-code-index="2">
        <span class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-progress">03 / 04</span>
        <p class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-title">Ritual</p>
        {%- if section.settings.ritual_copy != blank -%}<p class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-copy">{{ section.settings.ritual_copy }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      </div>
      <div class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-item" data-house-code-index="3">
        <span class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-progress">04 / 04</span>
        <p class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-title">Longevity</p>
        {%- if section.settings.longevity_copy != blank -%}<p class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-copy">{{ section.settings.longevity_copy }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      </div>
      <span class="caviera-house-codes__line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script src="{{ 'caviera-house-codes.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "House Codes",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "header", "content": "01 Rarity" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "rarity_image", "label": "Rarity image", "info": "Jewellery isolated in strong negative space — unusual composition, object-led, not a styled lifestyle shot. Falls back to a bundled CAVIERA photograph when left blank." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "rarity_copy", "label": "Short line", "default": "Unexpected, never ornamental for its own sake." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "02 Precision" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "precision_image", "label": "Precision image", "info": "Diamond macro, setting detail, or faceted/geometric construction. Falls back to the same bundled photograph (differently cropped) when left blank." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "precision_copy", "label": "Short line", "default": "Every cut, line and word earns its place." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "03 Ritual" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "ritual_image", "label": "Ritual image", "info": "Packaging reveal, House Seal, or an opening gesture. Falls back to the same bundled photograph (differently cropped) when left blank." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "ritual_copy", "label": "Short line", "default": "Discovery is paced, tactile and memorable." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "04 Longevity" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "longevity_image", "label": "Longevity image", "info": "A gold object, maker's mark, or provenance detail. Falls back to the same bundled photograph (differently cropped) when left blank." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "longevity_copy", "label": "Short line", "default": "Objects and identity are made to age well." }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "House Codes" }],
  "enabled_on": {
    "templates": ["index"]
  }
}
{% endschema %}
